240U     238U(136XE,XG),(70ZN,XG)      2015Bi08                  25NDS    202511
240U   H TYP=FUL$AUT=C. Morse$CIT=NDS 206, 359 (2025)$CUT=27-Sep-2024$          
240U  c  $ 2015Bi08: {+240}U produced at INFN Legnaro in two multinucleon       
240U 2c  transfer reactions on a {+238}U target.  The first experiment used     
240U 3c  the ({+70}Zn,{+68}Zn) reaction at 460 MeV, with reaction products      
240U 4c  identified using the PRISMA detector and |g rays measured with the     
240U 5c  CLARA HPGe detector array.  The second experiment used the             
240U 6c  ({+136}Xe,{+134}Xe) reaction at 1 GeV, with reaction products          
240U 7c  identified using PRISMA and |g rays measured using the AGATA           
240U 8c  demonstrator.  Measured E{-|g}, I{-|g}, |g|g coincidence.              
240U  CL BAND(A)$Ground-state band                                              
240U  CL BAND(B)$K{+|p}=0{+-}, octupole band                                    
