240PU cL E(K)$From extrapolation of moment of inertia plot for the band         
240PU2cL (2001Ga05)                                                             
240PU cL E(L)$From 2001Th16                                                     
240PU cL E(M)$From 2001Th16; 1651+x in 2001Ga05                                 
